From: Artem Butusov <art.sormy@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] drm/rockchip: vop2: Gamma LUT on the RK3528's VP0

The RK3528's VP0 has a 1024-entry gamma lookup table, loaded as the
RK3588's is; VP1, the composite port, has none. Give VP0 its length,
and attach the gamma properties only to a port that has a table.

Signed-off-by: Artem Butusov <art.sormy@gmail.com>
---
diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/rockchip/rockchip_drm_vop2.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/rockchip/rockchip_drm_vop2.c
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/rockchip/rockchip_drm_vop2.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/rockchip/rockchip_drm_vop2.c
@@ -3082,7 +3082,7 @@
 		drm_crtc_attach_background_color_property(&vp->crtc);
 
 		drm_crtc_helper_add(&vp->crtc, &vop2_crtc_helper_funcs);
-		if (vop2->lut_regs) {
+		if (vop2->lut_regs && vop2_data->vp[vp->id].gamma_lut_len) {
 			const struct vop2_video_port_data *vp_data = &vop2_data->vp[vp->id];
 
 			drm_mode_crtc_set_gamma_size(&vp->crtc, vp_data->gamma_lut_len);
diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/rockchip/rockchip_vop2_reg.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/rockchip/rockchip_vop2_reg.c
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/rockchip/rockchip_vop2_reg.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/rockchip/rockchip_vop2_reg.c
@@ -2646,6 +2646,7 @@
 		.offset = 0xc00,
 		.pixel_rate = 1,
 		.nlayers = 4,
+		.gamma_lut_len = 1024,
 	}, {
 		.id = 1,
 		.max_output = { 720, 576 },
